<!-- The name at the foot of the splash, set in the one face quire says its own
     name in, as outlines: a window drawn before the app has started cannot ask
     the app for a font.

     The box is the branding slot's own, 200 by 80, with the line centred in
     it rather than filling it. Android hands this drawable to whichever of two
     phones it is on, and they do not agree: one fits it inside the slot and
     one stretches it to fill, and a line with its own tight box comes out of
     the second one twice as tall as it was drawn. A box that is already the
     slot's shape reads the same either way. -->
